#: ../plugins/a11y-keyboard/gsd-a11y-keyboard-manager.c:400
msgid "Slow Keys Turned On"
msgstr "ਹੌਲੀ ਸਵਿੱਚ ਚਾਲੂ ਹੋਈਆਂ"

